# The extractor image needs Go source and the module files; it does not need
# the desktop frontend, local PDFs, credentials, or repository history.
#
# Excluding test-data is a privacy rule as much as a size one: those are local
# customer documents and must never enter a build context or image layer.
.git
.env
.env.*
test-data
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
build
dist
*.pdf
